    Remove unused(?) waveform operation (#7574)
    
    The `partial-preview` workflow contains two waveform operations. While
    the second one is used in the editor, I was unable to find any use for
    the first.
    
    If anyone knows why it was added, please let me know. Otherwise, I
    suggest removing it.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Just upload a video using the default workflow and see if everything
    works as expected and the generated waveform still shows up in the
    editor.
    
